{
    "chapter_num": 8,
    "verses_count": 13,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Seventh Seal: Prelude to the Seven Trumpets"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When He opened the seventh seal, there was silence in heaven for about half an hour. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I saw the seven angels who stand before God, and to them were given seven trumpets. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then another angel, having a golden censer, came and stood at the altar. He was given much incense, that he should offer "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with the prayers of all the saints upon the golden altar which was before the throne. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the smoke of the incense, with the prayers of the saints, ascended before God from the angel’s hand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the angel took the censer, filled it with fire from the altar, and threw "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the earth. And there were noises, thunderings, lightnings, and an earthquake."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the seven angels who had the seven trumpets prepared themselves to sound."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "First Trumpet: Vegetation Struck"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The first angel sounded: And hail and fire followed, mingled with blood, and they were thrown to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M add and a third of the earth was burned up"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "earth. And a third of the trees were burned up, and all green grass was burned up."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Second Trumpet: The Seas Struck"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the second angel sounded: And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "something"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " like a great mountain burning with fire was thrown into the sea, and a third of the sea became blood. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And a third of the living creatures in the sea died, and a third of the ships were destroyed."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Third Trumpet: The Waters Struck"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the third angel sounded: And a great star fell from heaven, burning like a torch, and it fell on a third of the rivers and on the springs of water. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The name of the star is Wormwood. A third of the waters became wormwood, and many men died from the water, because it was made bitter."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Fourth Trumpet: The Heavens Struck"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the fourth angel sounded: And a third of the sun was struck, a third of the moon, and a third of the stars, so that a third of them were darkened. A third of the day "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "had no light"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "did not shine, and likewise the night."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And I looked, and I heard an "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M eagle"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "angel flying through the midst of heaven, saying with a loud voice, “Woe, woe, woe to the inhabitants of the earth, because of the remaining blasts of the trumpet of the three angels who are about to sound!”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}